            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-11824-sqlite-libs",
              "name": "ApkMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-11824 high vulnerability for sqlite-libs package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SQLite before 3.53.2 contains a heap-based buffer overflow vulnerability in the FTS5 full-text search extension that allows attackers to cause a crash or execute arbitrary code by supplying a crafted database with malicious continuation page metadata specifying a szLeaf value smaller than 4. Attackers can trigger an integer underflow in fts5ChunkIterate() causing an inflated remaining byte count during FTS5 MATCH query processing, leading to a heap buffer overflow of attacker-controlled data in applications compiled with SQLITE_ENABLE_FTS5."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-11824",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-11824\nSeverity: high\nPackage: sqlite-libs\nVersion: 3.49.2-r1\nFix Version: \nType: apk\nLocation: /lib/apk/db/installed\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2026-11824](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-11824)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-11824**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | sqlite-libs  | 3.49.2-r1  |   | apk  | /lib/apk/db/installed  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2026-11824](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-11824)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:apk/alpine/sqlite-libs@3.49.2-r1?arch=x86_64\u0026distro=alpine-3.22.8\u0026upstream=sqlite"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-119378-sqlite-libs",
              "name": "ApkMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-119378 medium vulnerability for sqlite-libs package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SQLite before 3.54.0 contains a use-after-free vulnerability in the R-Tree extension that allows attackers to make applications use freed heap memory by manipulating the %_node shadow table. Attackers can supply a database declaring %_node WITHOUT ROWID or with a RAISE(IGNORE) trigger so nodeWrite() hashes nodes as 0, crashing the process after node splits."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119378",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-119378\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: sqlite-libs\nVersion: 3.49.2-r1\nFix Version: \nType: apk\nLocation: /lib/apk/db/installed\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2026-119378](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119378)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-119378**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | sqlite-libs  | 3.49.2-r1  |   | apk  | /lib/apk/db/installed  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2026-119378](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119378)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:apk/alpine/sqlite-libs@3.49.2-r1?arch=x86_64\u0026distro=alpine-3.22.8\u0026upstream=sqlite"
                ],
                "security-severity": "6.8"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-116566-python3",
              "name": "ApkMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-116566 medium vulnerability for python3 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "socket.getaddrinfo() previously accepted null bytes within *host* and *port* parameters which can cause the values to be silently truncated."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-116566",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-116566\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: python3\nVersion: 3.12.16-r0\nFix Version: \nType: apk\nLocation: /lib/apk/db/installed\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2026-116566](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-116566)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-116566**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | python3  | 3.12.16-r0  |   | apk  | /lib/apk/db/installed  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2026-116566](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-116566)  |\n"
