            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-119373-sqlite-libs",
              "name": "ApkMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-119373 high vulnerability for sqlite-libs package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SQLite before 3.54.0 built with FTS5 contains a heap buffer overflow in fts5MergeRowidLists() that undersizes the output buffer when merging detail=none prefix doclists. Attackers who can populate a detail=none FTS5 table with negative rowids and run a prefix MATCH query can write past the allocation, corrupting heap memory and crashing the process."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119373",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-119373\nSeverity: high\nPackage: sqlite-libs\nVersion: 3.49.2-r1\nFix Version: \nType: apk\nLocation: /lib/apk/db/installed\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2026-119373](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119373)",
