            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-119375-sqlite-libs",
              "name": "ApkMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-119375 medium vulnerability for sqlite-libs package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SQLite before 3.54.0 contains an information disclosure vulnerability that allows attackers to read uninitialized page-cache memory by supplying a WAL file with an undersized page size. Attackers can craft a database and WAL file whose oversized record payload makes queries like substr() return stale bytes, disclosing other table rows and internal pointers."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119375",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-119375\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: sqlite-libs\nVersion: 3.49.2-r1\nFix Version: \nType: apk\nLocation: /lib/apk/db/installed\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2026-119375](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119375)",
