            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-119371-sqlite-libs",
              "name": "ApkMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-119371 medium vulnerability for sqlite-libs package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SQLite before 3.54.0 contains a stack exhaustion vulnerability that allows attackers to bypass the SQLITE_LIMIT_EXPR_DEPTH nesting limit because common table expressions are not counted against it. Attackers can supply a WITH clause chaining tens of thousands of CTEs, via plain SQL or a view in an untrusted database file, causing unbounded selectExpander() recursion that crashes the process."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119371",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-119371\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: sqlite-libs\nVersion: 3.49.2-r1\nFix Version: \nType: apk\nLocation: /lib/apk/db/installed\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2026-119371](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119371)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-119371**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | sqlite-libs  | 3.49.2-r1  |   | apk  | /lib/apk/db/installed  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2026-119371](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119371)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:apk/alpine/sqlite-libs@3.49.2-r1?arch=x86_64\u0026distro=alpine-3.22.8\u0026upstream=sqlite"
                ],
                "security-severity": "6.8"
              }
