            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-119372-sqlite-libs",
              "name": "ApkMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-119372 medium vulnerability for sqlite-libs package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SQLite before 3.54.0 built with FTS3/FTS4 and SQLITE_ENABLE_FTS3_PARENTHESIS contains a use-after-free vulnerability in fts3BestSnippet() caused by dangling cached position-list pointers. Attackers can run a full-text MATCH query combining OR and NEAR operators with snippet() to read freed heap memory and crash the process."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119372",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-119372\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: sqlite-libs\nVersion: 3.49.2-r1\nFix Version: \nType: apk\nLocation: /lib/apk/db/installed\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2026-119372](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119372)",
