            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-119377-sqlite-libs",
              "name": "ApkMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-119377 low vulnerability for sqlite-libs package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SQLite before 3.54.0 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability in lookupName() that invokes the authorizer only for the first joined table's USING column. Attackers able to submit SQL can query a shared USING column in a RIGHT or FULL JOIN to read columns denied via sqlite3_set_authorizer() SQLITE_READ restrictions."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119377",
              "help": {
